  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity International Climate Innovation Facility is a component of Global Network of Climate Technology Innovation Centres reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;11,711,666. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Environmental policy and administrative management, Solar energy for centralised grids, Basic drinking water supply and basic sanitation, Agricultural development, Power generation/renewable sources, Urban development and management.</narrative>
